===Proper noun===
{{de-proper noun|m:n,(s)}}

# {{place|de|country|r/Western Asia|t1=Lebanon|capital=Beirut}}

====Usage notes====
* The word is sometimes used without a definite article as in English: {{m|de||Libanon, in Libanon}}. In this case, the genitive is always {{m|de||Libanons}}, for example {{m|de||Libanons Hauptstadt|t=Lebanon's capital}}.
* More commonly, however, the definite article is used with the name: {{m|de||der Libanon, im Libanon}}. In this case, the genitive usually is {{m|de||des Libanon}}, although {{m|de||des Libanons}} is also correct: {{m|de||die Hauptstadt des Libanon(s)|t=the capital of Lebanon}}.

